  "abstract": "Covers Standard Schema v1 and Standard JSON Schema v1, the only version line, as published in @standard-schema/spec 1.1.0, with the upgrade from package 1.0.0; no preview exists. It teaches the ~standard property, StandardTypedV1, StandardSchemaV1 with its validate result shape, and StandardJSONSchemaV1 with its targets. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions, the full interfaces, consuming, implementing, JSON Schema generation, and the implementer tables as listed on standardschema.dev.",
